- [x] `src/cli/init/.aide` outcomes.undesired ("The CLI invents or guesses a vault path to fill the `obsidian` entry's path slot..."): refers to "the `obsidian` entry" — should read "the `brain` entry" since the MCP config key is `brain`.
  Traces to: `.aide/handoff.aide` (settled).
